{"overview":"سلیمان، پیامبر و پادشاه، از خدا می‌خواهد که برای او یک پادشاهی ایده‌آل بدهد که پیش از این به هیچ‌کس داده نشده است. به او گفته می‌شود که خود و مردمش را با موجودات شیطانی و فراطبیعی که مردان را می‌آزارند، آماده کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Solomon, Prophet and the King, has asked God to give him an ideal kingdom which has never been given to anybody before. He is told to prepare himself and his subjects with evil and unearthly creatures that haunt the men.","tagline_en":"","runtime":110,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["شهریار بحرانی"],"crew_en":["Shahriar Bahrani"],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"امین زندگانی","role":"King Solomon","photo":"/hLsTIjiXdERQ7jDdkvYtIoIYR8u.jpg","en":"Amin Zendegani"},{"name":"محمود پاک‌نیت","role":"Yazar","photo":"/rK6fa7MYfnEqql0oLartjGe966I.jpg","en":"Mahmoud Pakniat"},{"name":"الهام حمیدی","role":"Miriam","photo":"/n9e2oJnGHR3J7edVH8jICYU0mso.jpg","en":"Elham Hamidi"},{"name":"حسین محجوب","role":"Asif ibn Barkhiya","photo":"/l4jLGqcLJePC9gHIEd0KlSsnPw1.jpg","en":"Hossein Mahjoub"},{"name":"علیرضا کمالی","role":"Adonijah","photo":"/fLFwSC9KpoTuuC4nreiI1nCcP4R.jpg","en":"Alireza Kamali"},{"name":"Zahra Saeidi","role":"Michal","photo":"/dJLNQ2wiUSA09wwtVbvloVXqlM4.jpg"},{"name":"Mehdi Faghih","role":"Ara","photo":"/vkfDnjRQdABWatRGvWAXf7cfqzQ.jpg"},{"name":"محمدجواد طاهری","role":"Absalom","photo":"/54wyP6ETUtxlja0K5sEimO3L0R1.jpg","en":"‌Mohammad Javad Taheri"},{"name":"Sirous Saber","role":"Joab","photo":""},{"name":"Yousef Bakhtiari","role":"Raeil","photo":""},{"name":"Ali Bokaeian","role":"Moeir","photo":""},{"name":"ژاله علو","role":"","photo":"/kRlw5FjLnWyT60qA8IlS4xYuCZ2.jpg","en":"Zhale Olov"}],"trailer":"pOBwmC5XaGA","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/153779"}